Third-party components
----------------------

This repository contains no vendored third-party source code. At runtime the
collectors depend on software installed in the operator's own environment:

  - PowerShell 7+ and the Microsoft Az modules (Az.Accounts, Az.Resources,
    Az.CostManagement), which are installed separately by
    install_cloudshell.sh and are licensed by Microsoft.
  - Python 3 on PATH. The four analyzer modules under scripts/ use only the
    Python standard library and require no third-party packages.

The bundled test suite uses pytest when available, and otherwise runs on the
Python standard library's unittest alone.
